[size=5]Cartur's Sailing[/size]

A Sailing skill for Valheim. Steer a ship under sail to level it, and the better a sailor you are, the faster your ships go, the tougher the ones you build, and the more of the map you see from the deck.

Inspired by [b]Smoothbrain's Sailing[/b] (deprecated in 2026) - credit to Smoothbrain for the idea. This is a separate mod, written from scratch for Valheim 1.0; it shares no code with theirs.

[size=4]What it does[/size]

The game has no sailing skill, so this adds one, listed with your other skills. It rises while you hold the helm of a moving ship under half or full sail - faster at full sail.

[list]
[*][b]Speed[/b] - ships you steer sail half again as fast at 100. It's the helmsman's level that counts.
[*][b]Hull[/b] - ships you build have double hull health at 100. It's the builder's level when the ship was built.
[*][b]Exploring[/b] - the map reveals twice as far around you while you're aboard, at 100.
[*][b]Per-ship speeds[/b] - tune each ship by name, including ships from other mods.
[*][b]Sail locks[/b] - optional: make half or full sail wait for a Sailing level.
[/list]

Every bonus scales with level - at 50 you get half of it.

[b]Hold Left Shift while using a ship's ladder[/b] to push the ship away instead of climbing aboard - for getting a ship off a beach. Only when nobody is at the helm.

[size=4]Multiplayer[/size]

Install it on the server too and its numbers apply to everyone. The key stays your own.

[size=4]Requirements[/size]

BepInEx and [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/valheim/mods/1138]Jotunn[/url], which registers the new skill.

Source: [url=https://github.com/jekkle/cartur-sailing]github.com/jekkle/cartur-sailing[/url]

